{55}{Truthfully, I've been hanging around here for weeks hoping for a merchant or adventurer to come along who needed an extra hand. You see, I'm a workin' girl, mister, although not in the sense that you might think.  [She smiles.]  I might be for hire, but my skills don't require my clothes to come off.  Do you understand?}{Truthfully, I've been hanging around here for weeks hoping for a merchant or adventurer to come along who needed an extra hand. You see, I'm a workin' girl, miss.  Although not in the sense that you might think.  [She smiles.]  I might be for hire, but my skills don't require my clothes to come off.  Do you understand?}{}{}{}{lf1 1}
