{316}{This, I'm sorry to say,  is Tarant. Gilbert Bates, the inventor of the steam engine, lives here in a big, fancy house on the far end of town.  And then there's Tarant University, the shipyards, the factories, tons of shops and stores... Everythings so dirty though. I got tired of this place real quick like.}{This, I'm sorry to say,  is Tarant. Gilbert Bates, the inventor of the steam engine, lives here in a big, fancy house on the far end of town.  And then there's Tarant University, the shipyards, the factories, tons of shops and stores... Everythings so dirty though. I got tired of this place real quick like.}{}{}{}{}
