{329}{Welcome to the grand capital of Cumbria - Dernholm. As you can see, it's fallen on hard times. Anytime I thought Shrouded Hills was bad, I'd just remember this place. It's a dump, but watch what you say around here. They've got a pit for a prison they like to throw malcontents into.}{Welcome to the grand capital of Cumbria - Dernholm. As you can see, it's fallen on hard times. Anytime I thought Shrouded Hills was bad, I'd just remember this place. It's a dump, but watch what you say around here. They've got a pit for a prison they like to throw malcontents into.}{}{}{}{}
